  "handoff": {
    "summary": "Implemented deterministic fail-closed Nelder-Mead-only case, evidence, portable, durable-verification, and atomic-promotion tooling, then closed the independent review's receipt-forgery findings. Every case and supplemental receipt is now campaign-bound and signed by a candidate-reviewed operator-controlled persistent-host software key; this authenticates host/operator origin and does not claim hardware or remote attestation. Exact structured program evidence, strict duplicate-free JSON, exact summary bytes, browser identity/results, full lifecycle cleanup, and the 4000-evaluation bound are enforced. Source-current enrollment verification derives each public identity directly from its installed private key and enforces the canonical key path and private permissions. Against selection 606aa0209679751a3b53d877a1a3f2e3e8ea764c1c953e3ac4c28cb9db58d4b8, exact host verification passed for Linux x64 90e32c225499e35a6b19805c6b40f2e261c72eb5814e89358718c56246c43374, Linux ARM64 78d44c4f7112a2f36eaddfa53fe5b375c2eec232bc0a1bee203da287aac6fbad, macOS ARM64 ad9ad8bcd3f244220017efc0127bf7c094487c828d3f6e2e8b36f96855d7e654, and Windows x64 4b4fc63d18802dbf3faaf7c5bbc90e25d152ad30ab90e754be61beb6f17f5bce. The exact five-case runner passes against artifact 8abe4760d3be541fa9d86ad3af6c33eb3241d3e423fd20e4fc85393c141678eb. The production manifest remains in the one documented pending state and no final platform receipts were minted.",
    "risks": [
      "The production manifest intentionally remains pending and no final platform qualification receipts were minted in this tooling lane.",
      "The exact Chromium identity is intentionally candidate-bound; the persistent Linux evidence host must have that reviewed browser build available before final collection.",
      "Source-current test:numerics passes 23/23 and every architecture stage through CoWasm passes. The final integration-owned optimizer-opportunity manifest necessarily becomes stale when this lane's new qualification source is added: the lane expects 7f14119f1b52010c0668eb6230312a6bbacb652c6385a77d7f24624ef61f1d12 while the pre-merge shared artifact records a059f9c1f08bd4e93fcd2455b9d4dc53a792490213318a9b983a4160c49185cf. Integration must regenerate it after merging this lane."
    ],
    "next_steps": [
      "Re-review the authenticated evidence boundary and exact manifest/summary state machine.",
      "Merge this lane into integration, regenerate the shared optimizer-opportunity artifacts from the combined source, and rerun the full architecture gate there.",
      "Freeze the final clean candidate, generate one fresh campaign challenge, run qualification/run.mjs with each host-local key on all four persistent platforms, collect all seven signed Linux x64 evidence kinds, and promote only the exact canonical receipts."
